sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor S as Student (web UI)
    participant G as API Gateway (Traefik)
    participant A as Auth
    participant B as Booking
    participant T as Tutor
    participant W as Wallet
    participant Q as RabbitMQ
    participant N as Notification

    Note over S,N: REST = solid arrow, gRPC = labelled "gRPC", event = labelled "AMQP", local DB step = note box

    rect rgb(255, 236, 236)
    Note over S,A: Phase 1 · Authenticate
    S->>G: REST POST /api/auth/login
    G->>A: REST (public route)
    A-->>S: 200 Bearer session token
    end

    rect rgb(255, 244, 230)
    Note over S,T: Phase 2 · Hold the slots
    S->>G: REST POST /api/bookings (Bearer token, Idempotency-Key)
    G->>A: REST forward-auth: verify session, account state, capability
    A-->>G: signed actor assertion (60 s, RS256)
    G->>B: REST request + actor assertion + gateway credential
    B->>T: gRPC GetBookableSubject (subject, hourly rate)
    T-->>B: subject snapshot
    B->>A: gRPC LookupAccounts (student, tutor display names)
    A-->>B: names, account status
    Note over B: Local DB transaction (PostgreSQL booking_db):<br/>lock slots, validate consecutive 30 min block,<br/>insert booking PAYMENT_DUE, slots OPEN to HELD
    B-->>S: 201 booking, ETag = revision, hold 15 min
    end

    rect rgb(235, 245, 255)
    Note over S,W: Phase 3 · Pay from the wallet
    S->>G: REST POST /api/bookings/{id}/confirm-payment (If-Match, Idempotency-Key)
    G->>A: REST forward-auth (same as step 5)
    G->>B: REST request + actor assertion
    Note over B: Local DB transaction: save payment attempt<br/>and immutable charge command, then commit
    B->>W: gRPC ApplyLessonCharge (outside any DB transaction)
    Note over W: Local DB transaction (PostgreSQL wallet_db):<br/>row lock, ledger entry once per operation id
    alt Charge applied
        W-->>B: APPLIED (transaction id)
        Note over B: One local transaction: booking CONFIRMED,<br/>slots HELD to BOOKED, reminders scheduled,<br/>outbox row booking.confirmed
        B-->>S: 200 confirmed booking
    else Wallet balance too low
        W-->>B: DECLINED
        B-->>S: 402 INSUFFICIENT_BALANCE (top up, pay again before hold ends)
    else Response lost or Wallet down
        B-->>S: 202 pending operation
        Note over B,W: Recovery worker repeats the same operation id,<br/>after the hold expires it calls gRPC ResolveOrCloseLessonCharge
    end
    end

    rect rgb(243, 235, 255)
    Note over B,N: Phase 4 · Notify both people (asynchronous, after commit)
    B-)Q: AMQP publish booking.confirmed (outbox worker, stable event id)
    Q-)N: AMQP deliver event
    Note over N: Dedupe event, create email and push jobs<br/>for student and tutor (simulated delivery)
    end
